    26	
    27	`ShareLink` evaluates its item eagerly at view-construction time, which would re-run the whole
    28	export on every re-render of the Gyms screen. Generating on tap and presenting the activity
    29	controller keeps the cost where the user asked for it. (`Transferable`'s lazy exporting closure
    30	would also work, but it can run off the main actor, and the collector reads a
    31	`ModelContext`.)
