codex
The first concrete fidelity defect is in the active-workout path: an uncompleted entry stores the user’s current machine/free-weight choice only on live fields, while the collector always exports the not-yet-captured snapshot fields. That means a backup taken mid-workout can silently erase the equipment context the user already chose. I’m now checking the remaining edge cases and running the unit suite independently.
